<!--
    The IEEE 39-bus system, G30, G32, G35 and G38 replaced by converter sources, grid-forming: complements ieee39-ibr.xiidm
    (Ieee39IbrNetwork.createIbr, flat), as ieee39-gfl-extensions.xml but for the CL.. stations' control.

    The six machines left Ieee39DcNetwork's (ieee39-dc-extensions.xml): Athay's data on their rating, our subtransient windings, the
    simplified AVR, a PSS1A and a TGOV1 each.

    The CL.. stations grid-forming, Ieee39DcNetwork's CSW's control: a virtual synchronous machine, H 5 s and D 20 pu, a reactive
    power droop of 5 %, a virtual admittance of 0.05 + j0.2 pu, a current loop within 1.1 pu (1 pu in the steady state), its
    swing's transient damping, its power lowered with its DC voltage (5 pu/pu).

    The converter sources' stations averaged as Ieee39DcNetwork's, a 15 % phase reactor on their rating (R 0.003 pu), DC
    capacitors of 40 ms, a bridge inductance for their blocking; the far ones, CR.., grid-following on the DC voltage, behind their
    strong grids GR.., 30 GVA, X/R 10. Each link one lumped pi of its 400 kV conductor, 100 km: 2 L and C / 2 of CIGRE B4's
    +-200 kV per-km OHL pole data (0.8273 mH, 0.0139 uF).
-->
